      "content": "well i know it sounds like a lot but i read online that you have to use high doses to actually get the bacteria to die off. i've already been taking some cranberry extract too to help. if i just stay on top of the oregano oil and drink a ton of water, isn't that basically the same thing as a round of antibiotics? i really don't want to deal with the side effects of real meds if i can avoid it.",
